<title>USA: Asset Guaranty qualifies one issue for insurance.</title>
<headline>Asset Guaranty qualifies one issue for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asset Guaranty Insurance Co. said on Thursday it qualified Willow Fork Drainage District, Texas, $4.45 million for bond insurance. The deal is scheduled for competitive sale today at 1230 EDT. Insurance is made available at the bidders option.</p>
<p>For more information contact John Deluca at 212-984-9222. --U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
